  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ruby Cup is a menstrual cup made of medical grade silicone re-usable  up to 10 years. Makit is a for profit company that is running a       social business with the business idea providing menstrual cups to girls in townships in Kenya. Agreement partner is Makit East Africa ltd, org reg no CPR/2011/61152, Kenya.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ruby Cup &#xe4;r ett menskydd som kan &#xe5;teranv&#xe4;ndas och r&#xe4;cker i 10 &#xe5;r. Makit &#xe4;r ett vinstrdivande f&#xf6;retag som drivs med ett f&#xf6;retag med socialt &#xe5;tagande. Deras aff&#xe4;rside g&#xe5;r ut p&#xe5; att ge/s&#xe4;lja billigt (f&#xf6;r 100 000 Shilling) en &quot;ruby cup&quot; till flickor i townships i Kenya per  k&#xf6;pt Ruby cup. Avtalspart &#xe4;r Makit East Africa ltd, org.nr CPR/2011/61152, Kenya.</narrative>
  </description>
